{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.poster.avif?t=1760353031\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.webm?t=1760353031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.mp4?t=1760353031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gather your crew and venture into the Pact Worlds in a tale of unlikely heroes, cosmic wonders, and the bonds that define us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy faces annihilation, your captain has vanished, and doomsday looms. Assemble a crew of misfits from across the stars and become the legends in this <strong>single player</strong> <strong>party-based RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/455fdaa5e3092f0bc732bb305bae1f5f.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/455fdaa5e3092f0bc732bb305bae1f5f.webp?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>6 unique companions</strong> scattered across the stars\u2014from android assassins to mystic prophets. Each brings personal stories and moral dilemmas. The bonds you forge through triumph and loss will determine their destinies\u2014and whether the galaxy survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/d6948a908b883bd74b28f5f57f9ce28c.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=370 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>turn-based tactical combat</strong> with Starfinder's classes\u2014Soldier, Envoy, Operative, Mystic, Solarian and Witchwarper. Use Paizo's critically acclaimed three-action system to fuel endless strategies. <strong>Level up</strong> and collect alien gear while battling everything from <i>Hellknights</i> to <i>digital ghosts</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/c3fc37369ce4b149c8b2bb0671aaf0e4.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=438 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>branching narrative</strong> where choices matter. Nothing is forbidden\u2014everything has consequences. Choose salvation or profit, mercy or vengeance. Factions remember your deeds, companions judge your heart, creating <strong>hundreds of unique paths</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/66527b6540770f2becbf998bf0be03ca.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=364 /></span>From <i>Absalom Station</i> to <i>Eox's</i> undead empire, from digital gods to cosmic dragons. Explore the <i>Pact Worlds</i> across <strong>40-60 hours of adventure</strong> where magic and technology unite. In this universe, everything is possible\u2014and probably is trying to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/f85c6703d3263be8f07a25f4b9702d89.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=634 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/6e53601788b625bb21159e0a461d9080.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=186 /></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3245640?t=1760353031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3245640?t=1760353031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/8d0cfdf1b55cd50dd4af0d2c75b58dfe88a3fa1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760353031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/8d0cfdf1b55cd50dd4af0d2c75b58dfe88a3fa1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760353031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game is set in the Starfinder universe and contains mature themes that may not be suitable for all players.\r\nPlayers will engage in combat with a variety of enemies using weapons and abilities. Scenes may include depictions of injury and distress.\r\nDialogue may include occasional profanity and suggestive language, including innuendo and sex-related references.\r\nThe game features references to both legal and illegal substance use within a narrative context. \r\nPlayer discretion is advised when exploring the darker corners of the galaxy."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.poster.avif?t=1760353031\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.webm?t=1760353031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/e40d6ef06dc1f2cd03efd09015fe256b.mp4?t=1760353031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gather your crew and venture into the Pact Worlds in a tale of unlikely heroes, cosmic wonders, and the bonds that define us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy faces annihilation, your captain has vanished, and doomsday looms. Assemble a crew of misfits from across the stars and become the legends in this <strong>single player</strong> <strong>party-based RPG</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/455fdaa5e3092f0bc732bb305bae1f5f.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/455fdaa5e3092f0bc732bb305bae1f5f.webp?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>6 unique companions</strong> scattered across the stars\u2014from android assassins to mystic prophets. Each brings personal stories and moral dilemmas. The bonds you forge through triumph and loss will determine their destinies\u2014and whether the galaxy survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/d6948a908b883bd74b28f5f57f9ce28c.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=370 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>turn-based tactical combat</strong> with Starfinder's classes\u2014Soldier, Envoy, Operative, Mystic, Solarian and Witchwarper. Use Paizo's critically acclaimed three-action system to fuel endless strategies. <strong>Level up</strong> and collect alien gear while battling everything from <i>Hellknights</i> to <i>digital ghosts</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/c3fc37369ce4b149c8b2bb0671aaf0e4.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=438 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>branching narrative</strong> where choices matter. Nothing is forbidden\u2014everything has consequences. Choose salvation or profit, mercy or vengeance. Factions remember your deeds, companions judge your heart, creating <strong>hundreds of unique paths</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/66527b6540770f2becbf998bf0be03ca.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=364 /></span>From <i>Absalom Station</i> to <i>Eox's</i> undead empire, from digital gods to cosmic dragons. Explore the <i>Pact Worlds</i> across <strong>40-60 hours of adventure</strong> where magic and technology unite. In this universe, everything is possible\u2014and probably is trying to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras_big/a7cc6a34e670eaf5c77d73c88593e4a3.avif?t=1760353031 width=1600 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/f85c6703d3263be8f07a25f4b9702d89.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=634 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/extras/6e53601788b625bb21159e0a461d9080.avif?t=1760353031\" width=1600 height=186 /></span></h2>","developers":["Epictellers Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245640/5f1d0c5c410a378836a0cafe4518d053f2b4c47b/header.jpg?t=1760353031","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3245640/1292730508/55d1e27dd0d77d5809bd88742d19f4fbda31a0f0/1759249704/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759497362","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3245640/1292730508/55d1e27dd0d77d5809bd88742d19f4fbda31a0f0/1759249704/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759497362","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3245640/1292730508/55d1e27dd0d77d5809bd88742d19f4fbda31a0f0/1759249704/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759497362","id":257209438,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209438/movie480.mp4?t=1759497362","max":"https://